  "lines": [
    {
      "text": "Real-Time Whole-Body Control of Legged Robots",
      "bbox": [
        131.06500244140625,
        74.0442886352539,
        480.9363708496094,
        88.3745346069336
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "with Model-Predictive Path Integral Control",
      "bbox": [
        150.68800354003906,
        93.96927642822266,
        461.31463623046875,
        108.29952239990234
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Juan Alvarez-Padilla1, John Z. Zhang2, Sofia Kwok2, John M. Dolan2, and Zachary Manchester2",
      "bbox": [
        86.38400268554688,
        126.85980224609375,
        525.1160888671875,
        138.7171630859375
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "This work has been submitted to the IEEE for possible publication. Copyright may be transferred without notice, after which this version may no longer",
      "bbox": [
        55.694000244140625,
        760.668212890625,
        556.303955078125,
        767.7935180664062
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "be accessible.",
      "bbox": [
        55.694000244140625,
        769.6351928710938,
        100.31063842773438,
        776.760498046875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Abstract— This paper presents a system for enabling real-",
      "bbox": [
        70.85800170898438,
        163.44715881347656,
        298.80059814453125,
        171.50794982910156
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "time synthesis of whole-body locomotion and manipulation",
      "bbox": [
        54.000003814697266,
        173.41017150878906,
        298.8006286621094,
        181.47096252441406
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "policies for real-world legged robots. Motivated by recent",
      "bbox": [
        54.000003814697266,
        183.3721466064453,
        298.8006286621094,
        191.4329376220703
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "advancements in robot simulation, we leverage the efficient",
      "bbox": [
        54.000003814697266,
        193.3351593017578,
        298.8006286621094,
        201.3959503173828
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "parallelization capabilities of the MuJoCo simulator to achieve",
      "bbox": [
        54.000003814697266,
        203.29713439941406,
        298.80059814453125,
        211.35792541503906
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "fast sampling over the robot state and action trajectories. Our",
      "bbox": [
        54.000003814697266,
        213.26014709472656,
        298.8006286621094,
        221.32093811035156
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "results show surprisingly effective real-world locomotion and",
      "bbox": [
        54.000003814697266,
        223.22315979003906,
        298.80072021484375,
        231.28395080566406
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "manipulation capabilities with a very simple control strategy.",
      "bbox": [
        54.000003814697266,
        233.1851348876953,
        298.8006591796875,
        241.2459259033203
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "We demonstrate our approach on several hardware and sim-",
      "bbox": [
        54.000003814697266,
        243.1481475830078,
        298.8006591796875,
        251.2089385986328
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "ulation experiments: robust locomotion over flat and uneven",
      "bbox": [
        54.000003814697266,
        253.1111602783203,
        298.8006896972656,
        261.17193603515625
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "terrains, climbing over a box whose height is comparable to the",
      "bbox": [
        54.000003814697266,
        263.0731201171875,
        298.80059814453125,
        271.1339111328125
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "robot, and pushing a box to a goal position. To our knowledge,",
      "bbox": [
        54.000003814697266,
        273.0361328125,
        298.8007507324219,
        281.096923828125
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "this is the first successful deployment of whole-body sampling-",
      "bbox": [
        54.000003814697266,
        282.9991455078125,
        298.8006286621094,
        291.0599365234375
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "based MPC on real-world legged robot hardware. Experiment",
      "bbox": [
        54.000003814697266,
        292.9611511230469,
        298.8006286621094,
        301.02197265625
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "videos and code can be found at: whole-body-mppi.github.io",
      "bbox": [
        54.000003814697266,
        302.9241638183594,
        291.68133544921875,
        310.9849853515625
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "I. INTRODUCTION",
      "bbox": [
        137.5260009765625,
        322.6093444824219,
        215.27879333496094,
        331.5158996582031
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Building robots that can gracefully traverse difficult ter-",
      "bbox": [
        63.96300506591797,
        338.8123474121094,
        298.8014221191406,
        347.7189025878906
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "rains and skillfully manipulate objects like humans and",
      "bbox": [
        54.000003814697266,
        350.767333984375,
        298.8010559082031,
        359.67388916015625
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "animals has been a long-standing goal in robotics. For a long",
      "bbox": [
        54.000003814697266,
        362.72332763671875,
        298.8009338378906,
        371.6298828125
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "time, the topics of robot locomotion [1] and manipulation [2]",
      "bbox": [
        54.000003814697266,
        374.6783142089844,
        298.8009033203125,
        383.5848693847656
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "have been studied separately. Recent interest in general-",
      "bbox": [
        54.000003814697266,
        386.63330078125,
        298.8010559082031,
        395.53985595703125
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "purpose robot agents (i.e. humanoid robots) in both industry",
      "bbox": [
        54.000003814697266,
        398.5882873535156,
        298.8008728027344,
        407.4948425292969
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "and academia has motivated designing control and planning",
      "bbox": [
        54.000003814697266,
        410.54327392578125,
        298.8009338378906,
        419.4498291015625
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "algorithms capable of mastering both locomotion and ma-",
      "bbox": [
        54.000003814697266,
        422.499267578125,
        298.80096435546875,
        431.40582275390625
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "nipulation skills in the same embodiment [3], [4]. Despite",
      "bbox": [
        54.000003814697266,
        434.4542541503906,
        298.801025390625,
        443.3608093261719
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "this rise in interest, general methods capable of producing",
      "bbox": [
        54.000003814697266,
        446.40924072265625,
        298.80096435546875,
        455.3157958984375
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "whole-body behaviors in real time on real-world quadruped",
      "bbox": [
        54.000003814697266,
        458.3642272949219,
        298.801025390625,
        467.2707824707031
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "and humanoid robots have so far remained elusive.",
      "bbox": [
        54.000003814697266,
        470.3192138671875,
        263.2146301269531,
        479.22576904296875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "In this paper, we take advantage of the increasing per-",
      "bbox": [
        63.96300506591797,
        482.459228515625,
        298.8013916015625,
        491.36578369140625
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "formance of modern-day robotics simulation technology, in",
      "bbox": [
        54.000003814697266,
        494.41522216796875,
        298.80096435546875,
        503.32177734375
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "particular, the MuJoCo physics engine [5], to compute real-",
      "bbox": [
        54.000003814697266,
        506.3702392578125,
        298.8009338378906,
        515.2767944335938
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "time control policies on legged robots using model-predictive",
      "bbox": [
        54.000003814697266,
        518.3251953125,
        298.8008728027344,
        527.2317504882812
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "path integral control (MPPI) [6], [7]. Contrary to the common",
      "bbox": [
        54.000003814697266,
        530.2802124023438,
        298.801025390625,
        539.186767578125
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "belief that sampling approaches in high-dimensional tasks are",
      "bbox": [
        54.000003814697266,
        542.2352294921875,
        298.8009948730469,
        551.1417846679688
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "computationally intractable, especially in real-time scenarios,",
      "bbox": [
        54.000003814697266,
        554.190185546875,
        298.80108642578125,
        563.0967407226562
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "we find that MPPI can be surprisingly effective at solving",
      "bbox": [
        54.000003814697266,
        566.1461791992188,
        298.8009948730469,
        575.052734375
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "legged robot locomotion and manipulation tasks with a few",
      "bbox": [
        54.000003814697266,
        578.1011962890625,
        298.8009948730469,
        587.0077514648438
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "simple design choices. To the best knowledge of the authors,",
      "bbox": [
        54.000003814697266,
        590.0562133789062,
        298.80096435546875,
        598.9627685546875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "this work represents the first time sample-based whole-body",
      "bbox": [
        54.000003814697266,
        602.01123046875,
        298.801025390625,
        610.9177856445312
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "control has been successfully deployed on real-world legged",
      "bbox": [
        54.000003814697266,
        613.9661865234375,
        298.8009948730469,
        622.8727416992188
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "robots.",
      "bbox": [
        54.000003814697266,
        625.9221801757812,
        81.39714813232422,
        634.8287353515625
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "There are several key design choices in our implemen-",
      "bbox": [
        63.96300506591797,
        638.0621948242188,
        298.8013916015625,
        646.96875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "tation: First, we reduce the size of the search space by",
      "bbox": [
        54.000003814697266,
        650.0172119140625,
        298.80108642578125,
        658.9237670898438
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
